    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Enable this option on a world-tracking configuration ([`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration`](arworldtrackingconfiguration.md)) to instruct ARKit to provide your app with the distance between the user’s device and the real-world objects pictured in the frame’s [`capturedImage`](arframe/capturedimage.md).",
      "ko": "The value of this property is [`nil`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ObjectiveC/nil-227m0) if switching between multiple output sources isn’t currently possible.",
      "sourceHash": "43ee04ef7f290a49f50db3cda26eb173f2fc67ac26615835bd09d85ab35f5d64",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "ARKit samples this distance using the LiDAR scanner and provides the results through the [`smoothedSceneDepth`](arframe/smoothedscenedepth.md) property on the session’s [`currentFrame`](arsession/currentframe.md).",
      "ko": "ARKit은 LiDAR 스캐너를 사용해 이 거리를 샘플링하고, 그 결과를 세션의 [`currentFrame`](arsession/currentframe.md)에 있는 [`smoothedSceneDepth`](arframe/smoothedscenedepth.md) property로 제공합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "088da2afefdadae174455ce055c948f872c59fc569b2d667a05ffe97136c5f93",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "To minimize the difference in LiDAR readings across frames, ARKit processes the data as an average.",
      "ko": "![None](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8b8b374954d1be372f7535eaf283fcd0/media-2929213%402x.png)",
      "sourceHash": "665d58a1d2f54362111ea2a437a614e19498dc50fe792fdfd5299c718806a16c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "The averaged readings reduce flickering to create a smoother motion effect when depicting objects with depth, as demonstrated in [`Creating a fog effect using scene depth`](creating-a-fog-effect-using-scene-depth.md).",
      "ko": "평균 판독값은 깊이로 객체를 묘사할 때 깜박임을 줄여 더 부드러운 motion 효과를 만들며, [`Creating a fog effect using scene depth`](creating-a-fog-effect-using-scene-depth.md)에서 보여줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b35b01831ff6d237d210809372e2ca6d48cddfb085a4da940e7cfa17c8947394",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "Alternatively, to access a discrete LiDAR reading at the instant the framework creates the current frame, use [`sceneDepth`](arframe/scenedepth.md).",
      "ko": "대신, 프레임이 생성되는 순간의 이산 LiDAR 판독값에 접근하려면 [`sceneDepth`](arframe/scenedepth.md)를 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "58e908ebabcfb332d8c9cd2b9196e075fa1b5425e273165dc8d24fb052b568fa",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "ARKit supports scene depth only on LiDAR-capable devices, so call [`supportsFrameSemantics(_:)`](arconfiguration/supportsframesemantics(_:).md) to ensure device support before attempting to enable scene depth.",
      "ko": "ARKit은 LiDAR 지원 기기에서만 scene depth를 지원하므로 scene depth를 활성화하려고 시도하기 전에 [`supportsFrameSemantics(_:)`](arconfiguration/supportsframesemantics(_:).md)로 기기 지원 여부를 확인합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9cf2a3d7849b3662081a2a81422849c53b5b4f83c7f1c72c3ec10b569fb9a53b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
